{"node_id": "real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11_11_HY_001", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0004"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0004_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "■ Apply cool, wet compresses to the rash to relieve pain and\nitching. An oatmeal bath or anti-itch cream such as calamine\nlotion can also help sooth your skin.\n■ Wear loose-fitting clothing made of natural fibers to reduce\nskin irritation.\n■ Keep the rash clean and covered to prevent spreading the virus\nto others.\n■ Follow your health care provider's instructions for antiviral\nmedications and pain management.\n■ Support your immune system by doing what you can to reduce\nstress (which can worsen symptoms) and getting plenty of rest.\nRemember, if you think you might have shingles, treating it early is\nimportant, so contact your health care provider as soon as possible\nto discuss treatment options.", "semantic_text": "■ Apply cool, wet compresses to the rash to relieve pain and itching. An oatmeal bath or anti-itch cream such as calamine lotion can also help sooth your skin. ■ Wear loose-fitting clothing made of natural fibers to reduce skin irritation. ■ Keep the rash clean and covered to prevent spreading the virus to others. ■ Follow your health care provider's instructions for antiviral medications and pain management. ■ Support your immune system by doing what you can to reduce stress (which can worsen symptoms) and getting plenty of rest. Remember, if you think you might have shingles, treating it early is important, so contact your health care provider as soon as possible to discuss treatment options.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0004_geometry", "bbox": [86, 206, 593, 559], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0004"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_5/hybrid/real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11/page_0011/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11_11_HY_002", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0005"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0005_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "For more detailed information on coping with shingles and\nmanaging its symptoms, check out MedlinePlus and the National\nInstitute on Aging.", "semantic_text": "For more detailed information on coping with shingles and managing its symptoms, check out MedlinePlus and the National Institute on Aging.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0005_geometry", "bbox": [73, 561, 579, 638], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0005"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_5/hybrid/real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11/page_0011/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11_11_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "The most effective way to prevent shingles is to get vaccinated.\nThe Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) recommends\nShingrix for all healthy adults 50 years and older, regardless of\nwhether they've had shingles before. Shingrix was first approved by\nthe Food and Drug Administration in 2017. According to the CDC,\ntwo doses of Shingrix are more than 90% effective at preventing\nshingles and its potential complications.", "semantic_text": "The most effective way to prevent shingles is to get vaccinated. The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) recommends Shingrix for all healthy adults 50 years and older, regardless of whether they've had shingles before. Shingrix was first approved by the Food and Drug Administration in 2017. According to the CDC, two doses of Shingrix are more than 90% effective at preventing shingles and its potential complications.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [73, 685, 609, 867], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_5/hybrid/real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11/page_0011/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11_11_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0008"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0008_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Shingrix is given as two doses typically two to six months apart.\nIt is available at most pharmacies and doctors' offices. Even if you've\nalready had shingles or received Zostavax, which is the older shingles\nvaccine and is no longer available in the United States, getting\nvaccinated with Shingrix can help protect you from future outbreaks.", "semantic_text": "Shingrix is given as two doses typically two to six months apart. It is available at most pharmacies and doctors' offices. Even if you've already had shingles or received Zostavax, which is the older shingles vaccine and is no longer available in the United States, getting vaccinated with Shingrix can help protect you from future outbreaks.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0008_geometry", "bbox": [73, 869, 607, 997], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0008"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_5/hybrid/real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11/page_0011/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11_11_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0009"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0009_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "If you're over age 50, talk to your health care provider about the\nShingrix vaccine. Your doctor may also recommend the vaccine if\nyou have a weakened immune system due to a medical condition\nor medication and are over 19 years old. Check if your insurance or\nMedicare can cover the cost of the vaccine.", "semantic_text": "If you're over age 50, talk to your health care provider about the Shingrix vaccine. Your doctor may also recommend the vaccine if you have a weakened immune system due to a medical condition or medication and are over 19 years old. Check if your insurance or Medicare can cover the cost of the vaccine.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [73, 1000, 590, 1127], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_5/hybrid/real_050_MedlinePlus-Magazine-2024-Issue11/page_0011/decisions.json"}
